EXT. ROOFTOP - SUNSET

CAPTAIN NOVA, a muscular woman in a blue superhero suit with a red cape, lands on the rooftop.

DR. KRANE, a bald villain in a black armored suit with a glowing staff, laughs.

DR. KRANE
You're too late, Nova!

He fires an energy blast. Nova dodges and punches him.

The rooftop EXPLODES. Smoke everywhere.

SLOW MOTION: Nova jumps through the fire.

NOVA
It's over, Krane.

She ties him up and flies away.

FADE OUT.
